# Build context for the Docker image (roadmap item 19): only what the flake
# evaluates and builds. The builder runs `nix build .#stt-app`, whose evaluation
# reads flake.nix, flake.lock, nix/ and backend/deps.json; the derivations' sources
# are the fileset-filtered subsets backend/ + docs/api + .editorconfig (backend) and
# frontend/ + docs/api (frontend).
.git
.direnv
.devenv
devenv.nix
devenv.yaml
devenv.lock
.envrc
workspaces
e2e
roadmap
docs/*
!docs/api
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.gradle
*.db
# The Dockerfile and this file are sent as separate build metadata; the flake never
# reads them. Keeping them out of COPY . . means editing the Dockerfile alone does
# not invalidate the context layer and re-run the ~11-min nix build.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore